      "message": "I do not want to support arbitrary JSON strings in our config file. Ideally we should look at why the multistr opt on the next line is insufficient and correct that, but a raw \"load json string\" seems like a very very bad idea.",
      "revId": "20c7750050763bf06bf648ba6bf9e8a8d490ce2c",
